/ The receipts list's "Read in a batch" button, loaded in a lazy Turbo Frame (OcrBatchesController#offer), so
/ the list never waits for the ML service. Empty unless the service says batch mode is available and the
/ filter has receipts to send.
= turbo_frame_tag "ocr_batch_offer" do
  - if @count.positive? && @capability&.available
    = ui_link_button new_ocr_batch_path(@filter.to_params), variant: :secondary, size: :sm, data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } do
      = ui_icon "layers"
      span = "Read in a batch (#{@count})"
